**/build/
xcuserdata
!src/**/build/
local.properties
# Everything the IDE writes for itself, except the run configurations, which are the project's:
# a checked-in `Desktop` entry means the desktop app is one click away on a fresh clone. Listed as
# `.idea/*` rather than `.idea` because git does not look inside an ignored directory, so the
# negation below would never be reached.
.idea/*
!.idea/runConfigurations/
.DS_Store
captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
*.xcodeproj/*
!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
!*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
!*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
**/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings
node_modules/
